SUMMARY:🌳🚶‍♂️ UNIONVILLE TRAIL HIKE & HISTORIC MAIN STREET! 
 🚶‍♀️🌳
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\n# 🌳🚶‍♂️ UNIONVILLE TRA
 IL HIKE & HISTORIC MAIN STREET! 🚶‍♀️🌳\n\n**Forest Trails\, Sma
 ll-Town Charm & One of the GTA's Most Beautiful Villages**\n\nNeed a break
  from the city without travelling too far?\nJoin us for a day exploring **
 Unionville**\, one of the GTA's most charming and picturesque communities.
 \n\nWe'll spend the day enjoying peaceful forest trails\, walking along th
 e Rouge River\, and finishing back at the\nhistoric Main Street\, where be
 autifully preserved heritage buildings\, cafés\, boutiques\, and tree-lin
 ed streets make it feel like you've stepped into another era.\n\nIt's the 
 perfect mix of nature\, history\, and great conversation.\nThis isn't a ra
 ce or a difficult hike—it's a relaxed social day outdoors where the jour
 ney is just as important as the destination.\n\n📲 **Don't Forget to joi
 n our WhatsApp Group – CLICK HERE!**\n\n***\n\n## 🚶‍♂️ What We'
 ll Do\n\nWe'll travel together to Unionville before beginning our hike thr
 ough the beautiful trail system that winds through forests\, meadows\, and
  along the Rouge River.\nThe trails are peaceful\, well-maintained\, and o
 ffer a wonderful escape from the city while still being close to Toronto.\
 n\nAlong the way we'll stop in a scenic park for about **30 minutes** to e
 njoy lunch together\, so bring something to eat—and if you'd like\, some
 thing small to share with the group.\n\nAfter our hike\, those that want t
 o stay back an exploring **Historic Unionville Main Street**\, one of the 
 most beautiful heritage districts in Ontario. Filled with charming shops\,
  cafés\, and beautifully restored buildings dating back to the 1800s\, it
 's easy to see why Unionville has been featured in so many movies and tele
 vision productions.\n\nExpect a full day of walking\, fresh air\, and plen
 ty of opportunities to meet new people.\n\n***\n\n## 🌦️ Weather & Exp
 ectations\n\nThis event happens rain or shine.\nThe trails are easy to mod
 erate\, but please come prepared for several hours of walking.\nComfortabl
 e walking shoes are highly recommended.\n\n***\n\n## 🧢 Meetup Details\n
 \n### 🚆 Meetup Location #1 (GO Transit)\n\n📍 Outside the **Fairmont 
 Royal York Hotel**\n**PLEASE NOTE -** This is the ONLY Meetup spot where w
 e will being meeting people at this location.\n🫎 I'll be wearing my **M
 oose Hat**\n⏰ **9:30 AM**\nWe will leave at **9:45 AM sharp** to catch o
 ur train.\nIf you miss us\, unfortunately you won't be able to join the gr
 oup.\n**GO Transit Cost:** $10 Go Pass - [CLICK HERE TO GET IT](https://ww
 w.gotransit.com/en/partners-and-promotions/weekend-passes-with-go) (one we
 ek before)\n\n### 🚗 Meetup Location #2 (Drivers)\n\n📍 Outside the **
 Starbucks in Unionville**\n⏰ **11:15 AM**\nWe will wait until **11:20 AM
 ** before beginning the hike.\n**[CLICK HERE](google.com/maps/place/old+un
 ionville+starbucks/data=!4m2!3m1!1s0x89d4d5c824f03db7:0x6801054f8397d225?s
 a=X&ved=1t:242&ictx=111)** for the Google Maps location.\n\n***\n\n## 🥪
  Lunch Break\n\nWe'll stop in a beautiful park for approximately **30 minu
 tes**.\nBring your own lunch\, snacks\, and if you'd like\, something smal
 l to share with the group.\n\n***\n\n## 🚆 Heading Home\n\nWe'll begin m
 aking our way back toward Toronto at approximately **2:00 PM**.\n\n***\n\n
 ## 🎟️ Meetup Fee\n\n**$5 cash in person or e-transfer**\n📧 **[math
 ewmaclean@hotmail.com](mailto:mathewmaclean@hotmail.com)**\nThis fee helps
  support the group and allows us to continue organizing events like this. 
 Thank you for supporting community! 💖\n\n***\n\n## 🎒 What to Bring\n
 \n💧 Water\n👟 Comfortable walking shoes\n🥪 Lunch or snacks\n🍎 S
 omething to share (optional)\n☀️ Sunscreen and a hat on warmer days\n\
 n***\n\n## 🌈 Who Is This For?\n\nThis group is open to anyone who wants
  to be social and make friends—whether single or not.\n\nWe also host:\n
 🎬 Movies\n🚶 Walks & hikes\n🎭 Arts & culture outings\n🍽️ Rest
 aurant gatherings\n\nThere's always something happening.\n\n***\n\n**REMEM
 BER:** You're welcome to just show up on the day if you're unsure about yo
 ur schedule.\nSometimes things happen and events may need to be cancelled\
 , so please keep an eye on updates.\n\n***\n\n👤 **Organizer:** Mathew\n
 Questions? Post on the event wall or email\n📧 **[torontomoviesandouting
 s@hotmail.com](mailto:torontomoviesandoutings@hotmail.com)**\n\n**Come for
  the trails.**\n**Stay for the charming Main Street.**\n**Leave wondering 
 why you don't visit Unionville more often.** 🌳🏘️✨
