SUMMARY:🌳🌊 HIGH PARK TO OLD MILL ADVENTURE - Stop  at Tom's Dairy Fr
 eeze - 12KM🍦🚶‍♂️
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\n# 🌳🌊 HIGH PARK TO OLD MILL A
 DVENTURE (12KM) 🍦🚶‍♂️\n\n**Parks\, Waterfront Views\, the Humb
 er River & One of Toronto's Best Ice Cream Stops**\n\nIf you're looking fo
 r a walk that showcases some of the very best of Toronto\, this is it.\n\n
 Join us for an incredible 12 km adventure that combines everything that ma
 kes Toronto special—beautiful parks\, scenic waterfront trails\, the Hum
 ber River\, hidden nature\, and\, of course... ice cream!\n\nWe'll begin i
 n the heart of High Park before making our way through the park's winding 
 trails and towering trees. From there we'll head down to the Sunnyside Boa
 rdwalk\, enjoying stunning views of Lake Ontario as we stroll along the wa
 terfront.\n\nAfter a relaxing shortt break\, we'll continue north along th
 e Humber River Trail before rewarding ourselves with a stop at the legenda
 ry **Tom's Dairy Freeze**\, a Toronto institution that's been serving some
  of the city's favourite soft serve\, burgers\, and fries since 1969.\nOur
  adventure finishes at Old Mill Subway Station after experiencing four com
 pletely different sides of Toronto—all in one walk.\n\n📲 **Join Our W
 hatsApp Group:**[ Click here to join](https://chat.whatsapp.com/DRFTkxRlHS
 4B3IL1lMleUd)\n\n***\n\n## 🧢 Meetup Details\n\n📍 **Meetup Location:*
 * High Park Sign (west side of Bloor Street & High Park Avenue)\n🫎 I'll
  be wearing my Moose Hat.\n⏰ **Meetup Time:** **11:00 AM**\nI will only 
 wait **5 minutes.**\nEarly is on time.\nOn time is late.\n\nPlease be on t
 ime as we will leave promptly.\n\n🏁 **End Point:** Old Mill Subway Stat
 ion\n*(Please note this is a one-way walk. We will not return to High Park
 .)*\n\n***\n\n## 🍦 Our Ice Cream Stop\n\nWe'll stop at **Tom's Dairy Fr
 eeze**\, a beloved Toronto landmark that has been serving delicious soft s
 erve\, burgers\, fries\, and frozen treats since **1969**.\nWhether you ch
 oose a classic cone\, sundae\, or milkshake\, it's the perfect reward afte
 r a day of walking.\n**Click Here to Learn More!**\n\n***\n\n## 🚶‍♂
 ️ What We'll Do\n\nOur route includes:\n\n🌳 Exploring High Park\n🌊
  Walking the Sunnyside Boardwalk\n🌿 Following the Humber River Trail\n
 ☀️ Taking a relaxing short break along the way\n🍦 Stopping at Tom's
  Dairy Freeze for ice cream - **BRING CASH!**\n🚇 Finishing at Old Mill 
 Subway Station\n\nThis is approximately a **12 km walk** and takes around 
 **4 hours**\, including our break.\n\n***\n\n## ☀️ Weather & Expectati
 ons\n\nThis walk happens rain or shine unless severe weather makes it unsa
 fe.\nAlthough this isn't a difficult hike\, it **is a longer walk**\, and 
 participants should be comfortable walking 12 km at a steady social pace.\
 nThere are also **several sets of stairs near the end** of the walk\, so p
 lease be prepared for a final climb before reaching Old Mill Station.\nThi
 s is a social walk—not a guided historical tour. The goal is to enjoy th
 e outdoors\, explore the city\, and spend time getting to know one another
 .\n\n## 🎟️ Meetup Fee\n\n**$5 cash in person or e-transfer**\n📧 **
 [mathewmaclean@hotmail.com](mailto:mathewmaclean@hotmail.com)**\nThis fee 
 helps support the group and allows us to continue organizing events like t
 his. Thank you for supporting community! 💖\n\n***\n\n## 🎒 What to Br
 ing\n\n💧 Water\n👟 Comfortable walking shoes\n🥨 A snack\n🍦 Spen
 ding money if you'd like ice cream -**BRING CASH!**\n☀️ Sunscreen on w
 armer days\n\n***\n\n## 🌈 Who Is This For?\n\nThis group is open to any
 one who wants to be social and make friends—whether single or not.\nWe a
 lso host:\n🎬 Movies\n🚶 Walks & hikes\n🎭 Arts & culture outings\n
 🍽️ Restaurant gatherings\nThere's always something happening.\n\n***\
 n\n**REMEMBER:** You're welcome to just show up on the day if you're unsur
 e about your schedule.\nSometimes things happen and events may need to be 
 cancelled—please keep an eye on updates.\nTo help us plan our events\, m
 embers who repeatedly RSVP and then cancel at the last minute may be remov
 ed from the group.\n\n***\n\n👤 **Organizer:** Mathew\nQuestions? Post o
 n the event wall or email:\n📧 **[torontomoviesandoutings@hotmail.com](m
 ailto:torontomoviesandoutings@hotmail.com)**\n\n**Come for the park.**\n**
 Stay for the waterfront.**\n**Leave with tired legs\, new friends\, and an
  ice cream in your hand.** 🌳🌊🍦
