DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\nHello everyone\,\n\n**\\*\\*Kindly
  Read Carefully\\*\\***\n\nPlease join me and my other groups on August 16
 th\; as we enjoy a great Sunday with a fun leisure walk through **Burlingt
 on Beach and the Waterfront Trail with other cool gems too.**\n\nWe will m
 eet out side of **Pizzaiolo**\n**1477 Lakeshore Rd.\, Burlington\, ON L7S 
 1B5**\n\nThis will give us an opportunity to introduce ourselves as everyo
 ne arrives\; then make our way out for our small adventure through **some 
 nice walking areas and fun site seeing :)**\n\nSincerely\,\n\nSteve Flemmi
 ng\n(Organizer)\n\n**Event Details:**\n**Leisure Nature Walk at the Burlin
 gton Waterfront! (Patio Dinner after the Walk)**\n\nIf you haven't been to
  Burlington Waterfront before now is the time\; and if you have join us to
 o.\n\n\\*We can stop and rest at different spots\, bathroom breaks\, take 
 some lovely scenic photos\, group shots and share some laughs\n\\*Play a c
 ouple new ice breaker games as well to help build some bonds\n\\*Great way
  to make new connections and build upon our existing friendships\n\n\\*Was
 hroom facilities\, water\, beverages\, snacks available there too :)\n\n\\
 *Stick around after if you like as we will extend our day together with di
 nner and cold beverages on one of the lake side patios\n\\*Probably go for
  Ice Cream after dinner :)\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\
 \-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Event Fee:**\n10 dollars (cash only) when
  you arrive\nor e transfer in advance to Steveflemming11@gmail.com\n\n\\-\
 \-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n\n**Time\,
  Parking and Location: Where to meet us?**\n\n**We will meet out side of P
 izzaiolo (Pizza place)**\n**1477 Lakeshore Rd.\, Burlington\, ON L7S 1B5**
 \n\n\\*Arrive early if you like (however we will meet out front at\n4:00 p
 .m. (we will wait for everyone to arrive until roughly 4:30 p.m.)\n\n**Par
 king Car when arriving:**\n\\*Park your cars in parking lot or the downtow
 n residential area (lots of places to park)\n\nGo Train will take you ther
 e by Union Station too :)\n\n\\*If you need a ride (leave a comment below 
 and someone might be in your neighbourhood to give you a lift)\n\\-\\-\\-\
 \-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n\n***Thanks for reading everyon
 e\, remember to RSVP and see you real soon!*** :)\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\
